OL,3,GNEWSAAquasplash closed as Legionella
OL,4,Abacteria detected
OL,5,
OL,6,FA swimming centre in St Helier has
OL,7,Fclosed temporarily due to the discovery
OL,8,Fof bacteria.
OL,10,FAquasplash said during one of its
OL,11,Froutine tests on Friday it found
OL,12,FLegionella bacteria in a "number of
OL,13,Fwater outlets within the facility".
OL,15,FThe bacteria can be inhaled through
OL,16,Fdroplets of water and can cause
OL,17,FLegionnaires' disease - with symptoms
OL,18,Fincluding a cough, shortness of breath,
OL,19,Fchest pain or discomfort, a high
OL,20,Ftemperature and flu-like symptoms, the
OL,21,FNHS says.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
