OL,3,GNEWSAAquasplash closed as Legionella
OL,4,Abacteria detected
OL,5,
OL,6,FSerco Jersey Ltd, the company that runs
OL,7,Fthe centre, said although the risk to
OL,8,Fthe public was "very low", it would
OL,9,Ftemporarily close to allow its water
OL,10,Fsystem to be disinfected. It added no
OL,11,Fcurrent cases of illness had been
OL,12,Flinked to it.
